{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Crazy Golf Party Is a new an excited golf game that tries to take the original format of crazy golf and bring it into game format in new and exciting ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <u></u><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524060/extras/DiscordCGP.png?t=1741198384\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit Our Official Discord For Crusade Developments where you can suggest and give feedback on crazy golf party! (Link In Info Section)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mutliplayer!</strong>\u00a0The game features 15 player coop that can be played Online or Lan with you, your friends and family to see who is the best golfer of all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524060/extras/imaiyuoiyoyoyoyge.png?t=1741198384\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Player Customisation!</strong> There is a variety of hats and skins that you can customise your golf ball to look any way you want from Cool to Goofy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524060/extras/Customise.png?t=1741198384\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> 5 Exciting Maps To Discover On Release!</strong> We have 5 maps on release, the maps releasing are Funderheim, Elden Forest, Egypt, Windmill Valley &amp; Haunted Hallows!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524060/extras/StorepageN.png?t=1741198384\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Themed Maps!</st